#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/terrain.md:133
msgid ""
"Open elevation products (SRTM, Copernicus DEM) are surface models, not clean"
" bare-earth DTMs — over forested or vegetated terrain, some canopy height is"
" baked into the \"ground\" elevation. A Canopy Height Model needs a bare-"
"earth DTM, typically from LiDAR, which isn't available through pygeofetch's "
"current open-data providers. This isn't worked around by fabricating a DTM "
"that doesn't exist — it's an stated limitation."
msgstr ""
"Los productos de elevación abiertos (SRTM, Copernicus DEM) son modelos de "
"superficie, no DTM limpios de tierra desnuda — en terrenos con bosque o "
"vegetación, parte de la altura del dosel está incorporada en la elevación "
"del \"suelo\". Un modelo de altura del dosel (Canopy Height Model) necesita "
"un DTM de tierra desnuda, normalmente procedente de LiDAR, que no está "
"disponible a través de los proveedores de datos abiertos actuales de "
"pygeofetch. Esto no se soluciona fabricando un DTM que no existe — es una "
"limitación declarada."
